  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Issue: \n\nA lot of new Sliders have been added and older ones have been moved around, while this was done it appears that slider snapping was forgotten to be added to a few of them.\n\n**Here is a list of sliders which currently don't have Slider Snapping support:**\n\n1. Earmuff Settings (Audio & Voice)\n\n- Distance\n\n- Falloff Distance\n\n2. Commons (Graphics)\n\n- Vertical Field of View\n\n3. Personal Mirror (Mirrors)\n\n- Opacity\n\n4. Face Mirror (Mirrors)\n\n- Opacity\n\n- Size\n\n5. Action Menu (User Interface)\n\n- Action Menu Opacity\n\n- Action Menu Size\n\n# Expected Behavior:\n\nAll of the listed slider above should support Slider Snapping.\n\nEdit: This is only a list of sliders I see in Desktop Mode, I so far haven't looked at them in VR yet.",
